Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.71,1:11:16.04,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}抱歉 不 是我的问题
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.92,1:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}只是太在意老师的奶子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.34,1:11:39.83,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以让我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.31,1:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}看看
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.39,1:11:52.47,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}你想摸摸看吗 对
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.40,1:12:07.45,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}这样就会好好练习了吗 会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.05,1:12:25.71,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}那就让你摸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.16,1:12:33.82,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以摸这吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.18,1:12:57.37,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}摸这边吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.51,1:14:02.24,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}你很会摸唷
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.63,1:14:13.71,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}大力点
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.20,1:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}怎么样啊 好大
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.11,1:14:31.77,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好软 软吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.35,1:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}喜欢吗 喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.23,1:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}那多摸点
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.84,1:14:55.35,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}人家乳头硬了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.02,1:15:08.81,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}快看
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.76,1:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}还想看吗 想
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.72,1:15:48.81,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.66,1:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}还想看吗 看更多吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.40,1:16:06.80,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想舔舔看
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.68,1:16:16.01,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}那就来舔呀
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.48,1:18:25.17,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}过来 好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.70,1:19:23.76,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我乳头好硬呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.64,1:20:30.72,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}过来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.61,1:21:40.07,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我也想看看 好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.33,1:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.54,1:23:51.10,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好想看喔
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.25,1:23:58.50,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}有点硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.88,1:24:33.81,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}舌头伸出来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.29,1:25:14.78,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以脱掉吗 好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.77,1:25:35.79,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}再给你爽一下要吗 好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.78,1:26:51.41,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}爽吗 爽 过来这边站好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.84,1:28:22.24,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想要更爽吗 好 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.26,1:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}上来点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.06,1:28:42.89,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}帮你做大亨堡唷
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.96,1:29:11.25,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.10,1:29:24.66,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师好想要你的肉棒喔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.95,1:29:38.88,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师要干嘛 你就躺着嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.84,1:30:02.50,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}要进去吗 当然呀
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.99,1:30:13.00,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以吗 好
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.93,1:30:20.62,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好硬喔
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.60,1:30:30.60,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}进来了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.39,1:31:19.35,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}有看到吗 有
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.90,1:31:36.26,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}大力捏
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.61,1:31:42.19,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.53,1:33:18.30,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我想动 你想大力点吗 对 好想
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.42,1:33:34.07,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}对 好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.67,1:34:20.20,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.97,1:34:57.99,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}这次从后面来吧 好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.57,1:35:01.30,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}插深一点喔
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.02,1:35:08.34,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}过来 好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.09,1:35:17.24,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}从后面吗 对
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.69,1:35:26.18,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}不知道怎么插 不要紧的 请教我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.38,1:35:41.88,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}对 这样很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.44,1:36:38.19,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师 好爽喔
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.86,1:38:41.22,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}过来这边 插深一点喔
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.01,1:38:55.23,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}进来了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.59,1:39:05.67,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}像刚刚一样插深一点 对
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.65,1:39:38.41,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}插好深喔
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.76,1:39:44.95,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}爽吗 爽
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.06,1:39:52.29,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}要去了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.97,1:40:00.56,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}很爽对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.64,1:41:43.14,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想去吗 好想
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.68,1:41:51.65,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}那卖力一点干喔 我要来啰
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.36,1:43:09.85,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我要去了 老师也要去了 一起去 好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.23,1:43:19.56,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}快来 可以射在老师奶子上吗 好 射多一点
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.79,1:43:38.81,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好多喔
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.20,1:43:48.59,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}真多
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.54,1:44:26.47,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}明天啊 老师 要开始认真啰 好
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.01,1:52:21.77,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}今天也好累
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.82,1:52:36.48,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}你是老师吧 好久不见\N是啊 最近好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.27,1:52:45.23,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好久不见呢\N老师都没变呢 反而比之前还美喔
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.11,1:52:55.01,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}你最近好吗 我毕业之后就努力读书\N现在是一流企业的主管 好棒喔 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.15,1:53:09.68,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}如果可以的话要不要去喝一杯\N你方便吗 我当然可以 那就小喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.83,1:53:14.95,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}那就一下吧 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.58,1:53:24.44,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师 干杯 干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.31,1:53:34.37,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}真没想到会遇到老师 就是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.76,1:53:46.35,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}能遇到我喜欢的老师真是太好了\N老师是我理想中的女性
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.80,1:53:56.29,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}是吗 老师太美了 大家都根喜欢你喔\N真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.08,1:54:04.17,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}大家上课都在偷看你喔 你也是吗 当然啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.72,1:54:17.52,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师最近工作顺利吗 还好呢\N最近不太顺利 可能是你不够开放吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.80,1:54:25.96,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}滴到了 不要紧吧 不要紧的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.41,1:54:34.20,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师 还真的都没变
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.05,1:54:42.67,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}身材也还是一样 是吗 有点胖了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.66,1:54:52.96,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}越来越好喔 真的吗 谢谢\N老师以前就不爱戴胸罩
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.90,1:55:01.77,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}对呀 被你发现啦 一定的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.54,1:55:09.13,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}大家以前都在猜喔 是喔
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.95,1:55:15.28,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}猜老师有没有穿 我以前就不爱穿
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.36,1:55:24.42,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我也每天都在偷看老师乳头
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.80,1:55:36.13,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}到学校是念书啊 当然\N但是 毕业还真难过噢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.25,1:55:44.18,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想到要与这对美乳分开\N是跟奶奶分开才难过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.39,1:55:54.35,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}没想到还能见到\N可以再近一点吗 近一点
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.06,1:56:02.22,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}多近 在眼前这样
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.01,1:56:06.83,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}来啊 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.71,1:56:14.44,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.99,1:56:21.68,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}太近了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.06,1:56:24.78,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}你太近了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.79,1:56:30.19,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好棒的奶子
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.64,1:56:39.06,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}别这样捉弄我嘛 老师
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.08,1:56:51.51,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}要是念书时也这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.75,1:56:53.87,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.63,1:57:08.13,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我想舔
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.44,1:57:11.97,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.73,1:57:41.66,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我还要啊 老师
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.22,1:58:00.91,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}变好大喔
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.17,1:58:18.99,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}这样摸是我梦寐以求想做的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.28,1:58:25.36,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}这边也要
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.92,1:58:38.98,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}有感觉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.40,1:58:44.29,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.57,1:58:51.39,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好美
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.41,1:58:54.23,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}再来
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.35,1:59:36.93,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}我想看 那脱吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.26,2:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}不是在做梦吧 不是唷
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.22,2:00:46.47,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师的奶真的好大
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.76,2:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}爽吗 好爽
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.11,2:02:20.66,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}穿得这么色喔
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.36,2:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}还穿了丁字裤呢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.04,2:02:51.04,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}真的好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.85,2:02:56.24,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}有感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.41,2:03:31.88,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}真的好棒喔 老师 要脱了喔 脱吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.02,2:04:08.55,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}再近一点
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.61,2:04:37.24,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好色的丝袜
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.45,2:04:44.71,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}那你就脱吧 我想用扯的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.76,2:05:55.58,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}再舔啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.30,2:06:01.26,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以舔大力点吗 快点
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.42,2:06:18.88,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}真的好爽唷
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.06,2:06:30.52,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}转过来给我看屁股好吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.87,2:06:38.30,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}挺出来点
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.07,2:07:11.26,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}很爽吧 喜欢我舔吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.56,2:08:06.71,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}喜欢我这样舔吗 喜欢 不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.63,2:08:43.55,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师帮你爽一爽
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.51,2:08:58.66,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}请帮我含
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.47,2:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以看吗 真害羞
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.28,2:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好大
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.05,2:11:22.31,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想被老师的大奶夹
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.22,2:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}吐点口水嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.49,2:12:31.57,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以舔老师吗
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.37,2:13:46.82,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}对 那边
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.10,2:14:23.60,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}有看到吗
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.97,2:14:56.52,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}小穴好湿喔
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.10,2:15:30.60,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}对 就是那边
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.91,2:16:13.37,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.87,2:17:14.96,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想进来吗
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.01,2:17:21.94,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想啊 那快呀
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.86,2:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}想插老师 那快点嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.43,2:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}真的有够硬
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.31,2:20:07.74,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.65,2:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}趴着嘛 过来
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.20,2:21:08.03,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好棒 来舔舔
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.05,2:21:17.74,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师还要吗
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.45,2:21:23.14,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}还要 过来
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.69,2:21:29.45,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}趴在这
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.17,2:21:37.20,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}跪好 挺出屁股
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.26,2:22:38.31,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.07,2:27:42.82,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}过来
Dialogue: 0,2:28:21.01,2:28:24.97,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}快点动嘛 老师
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.69,2:28:38.84,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}可以射吗 来嘛 射多一点
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.94,2:33:54.46,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}太爽了 我也是
Dialogue: 0,2:34:04.78,2:34:10.80,Default,,0,0,0010,,{\fn华文楷体\bord2\shad1\3c&H000000&\b1}老师永远都是我的 对呀

